        "attack": "挥拳造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。<#ff9028ff>监察<>：受到的伤害降低<#ffb900ff>10%<>，生命高于<#ffb900ff>50%<>时降低<#ffb900ff>20%<>。",
        "skill": "摆出防御姿态，<#ef5350ff>嘲讽<>周围的敌人<#ef5350ff>0.75秒<>，获得<#ffb900ff>40<>护甲和<#ffb900ff>30<>魔抗（<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>）；下一拳造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>物理伤害，队里每有一个<#ff9028ff>家人<>再加<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<>。",
        "skill2": "冲向敌人打出上勾拳，造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>物理伤害并<#ef5350ff>晕眩0.5秒<>，身边的敌人受到<#ffb900ff>35%<>的伤害。",
