        "attack": "长矛刺击造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。<#ff9028ff>野火冲刺<>：每<#ffb900ff>6秒<>下一击踩滑板冲刺，造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>伤害，回复上次冲刺以来所受伤害的<#ffb900ff>25%<>。<#ff9028ff>监察<>：生命不低于<#ffb900ff>50%<>时减伤<#ffb900ff>20%<>，否则<#ffb900ff>10%<>。",
